  "bio": "Welcome to Storm Cloud, a premier tattoo studio perched on the vibrant West Broadway of Vancouver, BC, where artistry meets tradition. Our gifted artists, including @stephy_b, @nate_tattoos, and @lenafauntattoos, masterfully blend illustrative and Japanese styles, ensuring each bespoke design embodies your vision with striking detail and fluid elegance. Join us at Storm Cloud, where ink becomes a testament to your personal story, etched in a space where creativity thunders and calmness resides.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Vancouver, British Columbia, Canada"
